WEBVTT

00:25.350 --> 00:27.110
In a future to come...

00:27.250 --> 00:31.590
the third energy revolution arrives
with the invention of the Shizuma Drive...

00:31.850 --> 00:34.820
and mankind reaches a
newfound period of prosperity.

00:39.330 --> 00:42.130
But within the shadows
of this bright peace...

00:42.270 --> 00:45.030
two powers clash against each other.

00:47.340 --> 00:51.300
A secret organization bent on
world domination, the BF Group!

00:52.710 --> 00:55.800
Everything for Big Fire!

01:16.100 --> 01:19.330
And to oppose this threat,
the Experts of Justice...

01:19.440 --> 01:22.340
is formed from members
gathered from all across the globe!

01:22.440 --> 01:24.300
The International Police Organization!

01:24.640 --> 01:29.340
With them is the most powerful
robot on the planet, Giant Robo...

01:29.650 --> 01:31.910
and the young man who commands it.

01:32.050 --> 01:34.180
His name is Daisaku Kusama!

01:35.820 --> 01:37.750
Crush them! Giant Robo!

01:44.030 --> 01:52.030
<i>GIANT ROBO</i>

01:58.980 --> 02:04.470
<i>THE DAY THE EARTH STOOD STILL</i>

02:04.880 --> 02:10.840
<i>Episode 5: The Truth of Bashtarle
Gone are the Days of Youth</i>

02:20.630 --> 02:21.630
Yes, that's correct.

02:21.660 --> 02:23.706
After causing the destruction
of the Shanghai Oil Fields...

02:23.730 --> 02:25.810
the Giant Sphere has
disappeared without a trace!

02:28.140 --> 02:29.140
I'm not sure sir!

02:29.210 --> 02:33.300
In any event, we can't get any
readings from inside the fire at Shanghai!

02:34.980 --> 02:36.570
There's no mistake about it.

02:36.680 --> 02:40.780
The fact that the newly installed
Shizuma Drives are working is proof.

02:42.290 --> 02:43.120
I see.

02:43.220 --> 02:46.680
That must mean that the
Anti-Shizuma Field has disappeared...

02:46.820 --> 02:48.520
Yes, there is no doubt about it.

02:49.090 --> 02:51.760
All right then, I will
trust your deduction.

02:51.890 --> 02:54.660
Go with the Gen
Brothers to the site.

02:54.760 --> 02:57.860
You must hurry to the
crash site of the Greta Garbo.

02:58.230 --> 03:02.500
Yes, and I have to relay what
we've learned about that Sample.

03:03.540 --> 03:05.670
Rest easy.

03:05.810 --> 03:09.250
I've already dispatched
someone to rescue them.

03:12.150 --> 03:14.170
Then, he's on his way?

03:38.610 --> 03:40.080
Daisaku!

03:41.410 --> 03:42.880
Daisaku!

04:41.470 --> 04:43.600
Tetsugyu? You're back already?

04:45.880 --> 04:47.210
How'd it go?

04:53.580 --> 04:56.680
Then, back there...

05:12.200 --> 05:13.200
Daisaku!

05:13.840 --> 05:15.200
Ginrei!

05:15.640 --> 05:18.440
Daisaku!

05:28.050 --> 05:30.490
I'm sure he's fine.

05:30.590 --> 05:32.710
Robo was with him...

05:33.220 --> 05:34.320
But...

05:46.040 --> 05:48.560
Attention Experts of Justice!

05:48.670 --> 05:50.330
Attention Experts of Justice!

05:50.910 --> 05:54.040
I have captured your
precious Daisaku Kusama!

06:00.450 --> 06:03.110
I will guarantee his life until sunrise.

06:03.450 --> 06:05.940
Bring the attache case
south of Karakoram...

06:06.060 --> 06:08.720
to the eastern opening of
the Great Himalayan Tunnel.

06:09.030 --> 06:09.890
I repeat...

06:10.030 --> 06:12.290
Attention Experts of Justice!

06:13.060 --> 06:15.790
Attention Experts of Justice!

06:16.300 --> 06:20.430
I have captured Daisaku Kusama!

06:22.740 --> 06:23.740
Oh?

06:24.310 --> 06:27.940
That Genya, he's quite
well prepared, isn't he?

06:28.180 --> 06:33.450
Now, let's see what he's really up to...

06:37.750 --> 06:39.050
Father...

06:39.320 --> 06:41.690
I never expected
Farmelle to be still alive...

06:41.820 --> 06:44.620
or for her to take
sides with the enemy...

07:01.510 --> 07:02.510
Daisaku!

07:22.470 --> 07:23.470
A fever?

07:24.130 --> 07:25.530
F-Father...

07:27.170 --> 07:28.170
Father...

07:32.270 --> 07:33.610
Father!

07:35.610 --> 07:36.610
Father!

07:36.680 --> 07:37.940
Father!

07:39.480 --> 07:40.880
Daisaku!

07:41.520 --> 07:43.320
Father, hang on!

07:43.850 --> 07:47.290
Daisaku, listen up.

07:48.220 --> 07:50.220
Your father can't go on anymore...

07:50.630 --> 07:54.060
I was hoping to make amends myself, but...

07:54.760 --> 07:57.860
Daisaku, do you have that watch I gave you?

07:58.400 --> 07:59.530
Y-Yes sir...

08:00.070 --> 08:05.300
This is the only secret weapon
that can fight against the BF Group.

08:09.610 --> 08:11.710
Don't do it, Professor Kusama!

08:11.850 --> 08:17.980
Do you know what it means
for you to give that to your son?

08:18.320 --> 08:22.260
Murasame, there's no more time...

08:22.730 --> 08:26.560
and there's so much
I need to make up for...

08:26.960 --> 08:28.520
But Professor Kusama!

08:31.600 --> 08:33.430
Now, Daisaku...

08:34.600 --> 08:37.600
Using this, you have to save the world!

08:38.240 --> 08:41.300
And please tell me...

08:41.980 --> 08:47.210
is it possible to achieve
happiness without sacrifice?

08:47.480 --> 08:53.550
Tell me the answer to
that question one day...

08:54.090 --> 08:55.090
Father...

09:07.240 --> 09:08.530
Father?

09:09.510 --> 09:10.560
Father?

09:13.040 --> 09:14.640
Father?

09:17.810 --> 09:18.940
Father!

09:20.180 --> 09:23.020
Father!

09:47.840 --> 09:49.070
Oh no!

09:51.610 --> 09:52.240
Stop!

09:52.380 --> 09:53.680
Stop them!

09:56.720 --> 09:58.240
Murasame!

10:34.260 --> 10:35.780
Cervantes?

10:36.130 --> 10:40.090
Daisaku, that's not something
a child should play with.

10:40.330 --> 10:41.700
Now give it back to us.

10:42.260 --> 10:43.030
No!

10:43.130 --> 10:44.790
I promised my father!

10:45.300 --> 10:47.570
I do not like insolent children!

11:40.820 --> 11:41.820
Robo!

11:41.860 --> 11:42.880
Didn't I tell you?

11:43.090 --> 11:45.060
It's not something a
child should play with!

11:45.730 --> 11:48.560
I promised my father...

11:49.060 --> 11:51.900
that I would defeat the BF Group!

11:52.000 --> 11:54.270
That is unfortunate, Daisaku.

11:54.370 --> 11:57.340
I always <i>did</i> like you...

12:00.910 --> 12:01.970
How dare you?

12:03.450 --> 12:05.850
Daisaku! The Rocket Bazooka!

12:05.950 --> 12:06.850
Murasame?

12:06.950 --> 12:08.470
What are you doing? Hurry!

12:08.880 --> 12:09.880
O-Okay!

12:10.550 --> 12:11.550
Robo!

12:31.910 --> 12:33.640
Why you!

13:03.440 --> 13:05.240
Robo, behind you!

13:11.610 --> 13:12.610
Oh no!

13:31.300 --> 13:33.200
GR-2!

13:38.470 --> 13:40.440
This is Robo's power...

13:41.440 --> 13:45.110
Can happiness be
achieved without sacrifice?

13:46.280 --> 13:50.010
Can a new era be
reached without misfortune?

13:51.520 --> 13:54.750
Please tell me the answers
to those questions one day...

13:55.720 --> 13:56.890
Father...

13:57.790 --> 14:00.390
Father!

14:02.100 --> 14:03.100
Father!

14:05.030 --> 14:06.190
I understand...

14:06.800 --> 14:08.130
I will...

14:09.100 --> 14:11.400
I will keep my promise to you...

14:12.170 --> 14:14.540
So Robo...

14:15.910 --> 14:17.110
Robo will...

14:18.780 --> 14:20.310
Promise...

14:33.160 --> 14:38.030
Yes, it's probably the
hardest on Daisaku...

14:39.130 --> 14:42.040
If everything was normal,
he'd have family and friends...

14:42.170 --> 14:45.070
and he would have lived
the simple, happy life of a child...

14:45.440 --> 14:47.100
He's only twelve years old...

14:48.980 --> 14:50.070
Yeah...

14:50.350 --> 14:53.410
he's got it pretty hard.

14:54.320 --> 14:59.520
His parents died and next
thing he knew, he was alone...

15:01.290 --> 15:02.820
S-Sorry...

15:03.160 --> 15:08.890
It's all right, I myself doubted my own
father, even if it was only for a moment...

15:09.030 --> 15:10.830
but Daisaku is strong.

15:11.230 --> 15:15.640
Being with Giant Robo, it's almost
as if he's always with his father.

15:16.370 --> 15:18.340
Compared to that, my father...

15:18.670 --> 15:22.630
Oh yeah, back on the ship
you called out "Brother"...

15:23.080 --> 15:26.340
but it's fine if you don't
want to talk about it...

15:27.550 --> 15:28.680
It's okay...

15:29.550 --> 15:34.620
I only had a glimpse, but I'm
sure that was my older brother...

15:35.960 --> 15:41.920
I had thought he died in the Tragedy
of Bashtarle along with my father...

15:43.030 --> 15:44.830
but I was wrong...

15:51.040 --> 15:54.240
That day was the last day
I was able to be a child.

15:54.510 --> 15:57.140
Since then, I've done as
Professor Go asked...

15:57.280 --> 16:00.980
I cast aside the name of
Vogler at the only place I could...

16:01.520 --> 16:03.950
the International
Police Organization.

16:04.520 --> 16:08.460
It was like running away
from the shadow of my father.

16:08.890 --> 16:11.020
But Daisaku is different.

16:11.130 --> 16:16.060
Even if he was alone, he'd keep
the promise he made with his father...

16:17.530 --> 16:21.830
I guess the only thing Daisaku has left of
his father is a great warmth in his heart.

16:22.570 --> 16:25.470
As for me, I don't have anything like that.

16:25.940 --> 16:26.940
Huh?

16:28.210 --> 16:31.810
Because when I was
little, with my own hands, I...

16:31.980 --> 16:33.780
This is the Sowabikatsu Rescue Team!

16:33.880 --> 16:35.580
This is the Sowabikatsu Rescue Team!

16:35.680 --> 16:37.410
Crew of the Greta Garbo, come in please!

16:37.520 --> 16:39.720
We are now in the skies over Karakoram!

16:39.890 --> 16:40.890
This is...

16:42.490 --> 16:43.490
Tetsugyu...

16:43.530 --> 16:46.150
I'm sorry Ginrei...

16:46.960 --> 16:50.020
But let me handle things...

16:50.570 --> 16:52.160
Please.

16:54.000 --> 16:55.530
Tetsugyu...

17:02.540 --> 17:04.170
Greta Garbo, come in please!

17:05.110 --> 17:06.170
Greta Garbo!

17:07.720 --> 17:08.720
Well?

17:08.950 --> 17:11.180
Is there still no trace of them?

17:11.290 --> 17:12.290
W-Well...

17:12.550 --> 17:15.150
The crash site is supposed
to be around here...

17:15.260 --> 17:17.780
but because of last night's blizzard...

17:18.690 --> 17:19.690
What's that?

17:20.130 --> 17:21.130
Where?

17:22.530 --> 17:24.800
Over there, at nine o'clock!

17:31.440 --> 17:33.340
There's no mistake!
That's a signal from Issei!

17:33.480 --> 17:35.270
Professor! There's one over there too!

18:06.980 --> 18:12.040
'

18:14.250 --> 18:15.250
Hah!

18:21.290 --> 18:24.170
The light of these lanterns is a spell
that cannot be seen by the enemy.

18:24.830 --> 18:28.350
Now if only an ally would see it...

18:31.900 --> 18:34.270
Oh no! It's too soon for
one of ours to show up!

18:37.140 --> 18:38.400
Curse you, BF Group!

18:38.510 --> 18:41.340
You will see the power of my wrath!

18:48.750 --> 18:49.750
I see you!

18:54.160 --> 18:55.160
What?

18:55.420 --> 18:56.420
This technique...

18:57.830 --> 19:01.130
Issei, I would hate for either
of us to die from friendly fire.

19:01.500 --> 19:02.500
Huh?

19:04.170 --> 19:05.570
Wait a minute...

19:06.000 --> 19:07.560
You're alive!

19:17.410 --> 19:18.640
How can this be...

19:19.050 --> 19:22.850
Taiso of the Celestial Nine is dead?

19:23.390 --> 19:26.320
And along with him, the Blue Beast...

19:29.490 --> 19:30.490
Professor Go...

19:30.730 --> 19:33.130
I just don't get it.

19:34.000 --> 19:35.220
This whole incident...

19:35.330 --> 19:38.930
For what reason does
Professor Vogler seek revenge?

19:39.630 --> 19:40.970
That's right...

19:41.170 --> 19:44.900
If he's the one who caused
the Tragedy himself...

19:45.170 --> 19:47.970
what possible motive
would he have for revenge?

19:48.110 --> 19:50.480
Misplaced blame? Because
he was caught in the explosion?

19:50.580 --> 19:52.410
This isn't about misplaced blame at all...

19:52.550 --> 19:53.550
What?

19:54.020 --> 19:58.540
Yes, if there's one thing he has, it
is a good reason to seek revenge.

20:00.620 --> 20:02.220
What do you mean?

20:05.830 --> 20:06.830
That's right...

20:07.500 --> 20:12.730
At least this man does...
Emmanuel von Vogler.

21:02.150 --> 21:03.810
Hey, Ginrei?

21:04.050 --> 21:05.050
Huh?

21:05.090 --> 21:06.780
You're fine as you are...

21:07.020 --> 21:09.250
No matter what, keep
on believing in your father.

21:10.290 --> 21:12.780
Think of everything that's
happened up until now as a dream...

21:12.890 --> 21:17.060
Don't doubt yourself for a
moment, you'll only regret it.

21:17.800 --> 21:19.770
Just like me...

21:37.950 --> 21:38.950
Ginrei!

21:39.450 --> 21:42.250
Well, we've brought the
case as you requested.

21:45.990 --> 21:47.190
Where's Daisaku?

21:51.830 --> 21:53.270
Ginrei, now!

22:02.680 --> 22:03.680
Daisaku!

22:03.850 --> 22:04.940
Daisaku...

22:09.320 --> 22:10.320
Daisaku!

22:10.690 --> 22:11.710
Daisaku!

22:14.620 --> 22:16.090
Ginrei?

22:16.360 --> 22:17.490
We can talk later!

22:17.760 --> 22:19.280
Can you get up?

22:23.630 --> 22:26.600
Well, well, planning on keeping
both the case and the boy?

22:26.900 --> 22:27.900
Brother...

22:29.370 --> 22:30.500
Farmelle...

22:33.940 --> 22:36.210
T-Then who's...

22:39.180 --> 22:40.310
What?

22:45.820 --> 22:48.520
W-Why you! You're still alive?

22:48.890 --> 22:50.590
Oh no! Ginrei!

23:05.610 --> 23:06.730
Tetsugyu!

23:07.310 --> 23:09.870
Now there is no one to get in the way.

23:11.150 --> 23:12.150
Brother!

23:12.680 --> 23:14.380
Well then, return the case.

23:15.250 --> 23:16.310
Brother!

23:16.550 --> 23:20.390
With the Sample contained within
that case, we will complete our revenge...

23:20.790 --> 23:22.520
just as our father wishes!

23:23.530 --> 23:24.690
No, brother!

23:25.130 --> 23:26.420
What's the matter?

23:27.160 --> 23:30.100
For the last decade, you must
have felt the same shame that I have!

23:30.230 --> 23:31.530
Why hesitate?

23:32.430 --> 23:33.430
Brother...

23:33.940 --> 23:41.940
If you return the case to me willingly,
I can protect you with my name.

23:48.280 --> 23:50.510
Or will you use your
teleport ability, Farmelle?

23:51.690 --> 23:55.520
You know what will happen if
you use that power carelessly...

23:57.060 --> 23:59.120
Why would you do it? Your duty?

23:59.360 --> 24:01.090
Or is it for that kid?

24:01.560 --> 24:04.560
You would risk your life for such things?

24:05.770 --> 24:06.930
Farmelle...

24:07.300 --> 24:09.670
For what reason have you survived?

24:12.840 --> 24:14.330
Shut up!

24:24.150 --> 24:25.150
Why you!

24:27.220 --> 24:35.060
Sorry, but I promised Brother Taiso and
Sister Youshi that I'd protect Daisaku.

24:37.100 --> 24:39.470
If I break that promise...

24:41.540 --> 24:46.800
they'll really kick my butt
when we meet in the afterlife!

24:47.410 --> 24:48.640
Tetsugyu...

24:50.650 --> 24:51.650
Damn you...

24:51.850 --> 24:56.340
But I'm not doing this just
because of the promise...

24:57.290 --> 24:59.720
I finally realized...

25:00.160 --> 25:03.720
The reason why everyone
wanted to protect Daisaku...

25:04.460 --> 25:06.450
Daisaku...

25:07.330 --> 25:09.730
When I saw you controlling Robo...

25:10.130 --> 25:12.730
I couldn't stand it...

25:20.080 --> 25:23.910
I couldn't stand how happy you looked...

25:24.050 --> 25:29.310
And then when I heard about all my
comrades who died protecting you...

25:29.450 --> 25:33.250
while you always seemed
to take credit for the missions.

25:33.390 --> 25:36.850
Why the hell are we doing this?

25:37.030 --> 25:39.720
That's what I thought...

25:41.660 --> 25:45.070
Then I got this idea about
how I could make you sad.

25:45.300 --> 25:48.760
That's why I took you to
Shanghai, and now look at the result.

25:49.340 --> 25:52.570
But I realized something while I was there!

25:52.810 --> 25:57.400
When I saw you holding onto
Robo and crying, it became all clear...

25:57.550 --> 26:00.520
I realized that I was looking at myself!

26:01.220 --> 26:04.980
That was the expression I had
the first time I killed someone!

26:05.450 --> 26:07.920
Although I didn't know it...

26:08.190 --> 26:12.020
I had killed my own father,
a member of the BF Group...

26:12.830 --> 26:15.300
With these hands!

26:19.030 --> 26:20.090
Tetsugyu!

26:21.040 --> 26:22.940
Damn! You half-dead fool!

26:31.050 --> 26:34.240
Yeah, that was the expression I had...

26:34.420 --> 26:41.020
Without realizing it, I was projecting
my own frustrations onto you...

26:41.160 --> 26:43.560
but I figured that out too late.

26:43.690 --> 26:45.420
I'm sorry Daisaku!

26:45.530 --> 26:48.960
But from now on, I'll protect you!

26:49.060 --> 26:53.060
So that you don't grow
up to be an adult like me!

26:53.370 --> 26:55.500
I'll show you! Gallop!

26:57.540 --> 26:59.030
Tetsugyu!

27:05.010 --> 27:09.180
I guess deactivating the Anti-Shizuma
Field was the correct thing to do.

27:13.450 --> 27:14.480
Farmelle!

27:14.860 --> 27:15.650
Farmelle!

27:15.790 --> 27:16.920
You're not my brother!

27:17.030 --> 27:19.090
You can't be my brother!

27:19.730 --> 27:23.130
That's right, there is no
going back for either of us!

27:23.400 --> 27:27.700
We must go through with our
revenge against those who...

27:27.900 --> 27:32.340
cast our father, Professor Vogler,
in the role of destroyer of the world!

27:32.770 --> 27:34.800
What good does that do now?

27:35.640 --> 27:37.510
Have you forgotten it all?

27:37.610 --> 27:39.956
Have you been able to live
your life, forgetting everything?

27:39.980 --> 27:42.820
Do you not remember who pressed
the button out of self-righteousness?

27:43.150 --> 27:46.280
And they call Professor
Shizuma the Messiah of Energy?

27:46.490 --> 27:49.550
Even if he could fool the
world, I could never forget!

27:50.290 --> 27:53.960
Never forget what really
happened at Bashtarle!

28:01.970 --> 28:03.870
No! It's too soon!

28:03.970 --> 28:08.380
But we've achieved a vector
reading of 98% with this sample!

28:08.640 --> 28:11.010
It's the highest we've ever achieved!

28:11.150 --> 28:14.810
That's true, but what
about the remaining 2%?

28:14.980 --> 28:17.280
How long must we wait?

28:17.390 --> 28:21.690
Who knows, it might be a
success even without the last 2%!

28:21.990 --> 28:22.890
What are you saying?

28:22.990 --> 28:27.160
You can't tell me that you don't know
what could happen without that 2%!

28:36.100 --> 28:41.200
See? We should not be doing
any careless experiments!

28:41.380 --> 28:43.000
You're wrong...

28:43.410 --> 28:45.470
Listen, Vogler.

28:45.610 --> 28:50.280
Looking back on the history of science,
is it not a history of experimentation?

28:50.720 --> 28:57.020
And have such experiments not brought
upon us scientists the light of glory?

28:57.430 --> 29:01.860
But it's also true that there have
been irreparable failures as well.

29:11.710 --> 29:14.270
I understand, it can't be helped.

29:23.820 --> 29:25.220
But Vogler...

29:25.950 --> 29:30.890
at the feet of scientists like us
is a mountain of those failures...

29:31.360 --> 29:33.450
Yes, of countless tragedies...

29:34.230 --> 29:36.060
You're one of them.

29:36.760 --> 29:37.890
No...

29:38.400 --> 29:44.200
Now is the time that we scientists
must step off the stage of failure.

29:44.910 --> 29:48.170
Why can't you see that?

29:59.520 --> 30:01.010
So, what do we do?

30:01.160 --> 30:03.180
Should we really postpone the experiment?

30:04.330 --> 30:06.820
Yes, what Vogler says has merit.

30:07.460 --> 30:10.590
But we can't leave
things to him any more...

30:10.700 --> 30:11.890
Then?

30:12.670 --> 30:15.070
Yes, we do it tonight.

30:26.150 --> 30:30.210
Huh? Strange, the power
levels shouldn't fluctuate here...

30:33.020 --> 30:34.040
Father?

30:37.890 --> 30:40.990
These are keepsakes of Father and Mother...

30:41.860 --> 30:43.060
Big brother?

30:44.170 --> 30:45.290
Farmelle?

30:49.240 --> 30:50.240
Father?

30:50.740 --> 30:52.870
No! It's gone!

30:53.240 --> 30:55.180
You go and wait in your room!

30:55.280 --> 30:56.280
No!

30:56.510 --> 30:57.380
Professor Go!

30:57.480 --> 30:58.480
Emmanuel?

30:58.980 --> 31:01.110
We have to stop Professor
Shizuma and the others!

31:01.420 --> 31:02.440
Where's father?

31:02.620 --> 31:03.710
He's with them! Inside!

31:03.890 --> 31:05.680
Don't do it! Listen to me!

31:05.790 --> 31:06.980
You shut up and observe!

31:07.090 --> 31:08.836
That's right! There's
no need to experiment!

31:08.860 --> 31:10.790
We will succeed this time!

31:12.130 --> 31:16.720
And the people of the world will
revere us with the glory we deserve!

31:36.980 --> 31:37.980
Wait!

31:38.290 --> 31:40.880
Do you see now? This is the missing 2%!

31:46.060 --> 31:47.260
The energy!

31:53.730 --> 31:54.730
Franken?

31:54.900 --> 31:56.100
What are you doing?

31:56.200 --> 31:58.260
I'm going to see with my own eyes...

31:58.410 --> 32:00.000
Stop it! Do you want to die?

32:00.140 --> 32:02.700
What is there to fear in the face of truth?

32:02.810 --> 32:05.250
You're the ones who
started this experiment.

32:05.780 --> 32:08.250
You don't know what will happen! Wait!

32:08.450 --> 32:09.750
Stop him!

32:09.880 --> 32:11.790
Stop Vogler!

32:12.220 --> 32:13.780
He's out of control!

32:14.060 --> 32:17.080
Pull him away! Don't let him get near it!

32:17.660 --> 32:19.290
Was this all for nothing?

32:19.460 --> 32:20.460
That's right!

32:20.860 --> 32:23.890
The experiment isn't
ready! It's too dangerous!

32:24.300 --> 32:25.530
It's too late.

32:29.600 --> 32:31.510
We're abandoning this facility!

32:31.710 --> 32:32.710
Fine then!

32:32.940 --> 32:35.930
None of you have the right to
become creators of the night!

32:49.960 --> 32:50.650
Father!

32:50.790 --> 32:52.190
Father!

32:54.100 --> 32:57.260
Quickly, Go! Please take both
of them and leave this place!

32:57.700 --> 32:59.030
But Professor!

32:59.430 --> 33:00.490
Leave me!

33:01.970 --> 33:05.800
The World is waiting! Waiting
for the fruits of our research!

33:06.770 --> 33:10.940
We must create this new energy
source as quickly as possible!

33:11.880 --> 33:14.110
In order to do that, we
mustn't have any fear!

33:14.280 --> 33:18.190
I have lived by this,
and I will die by it as well!

33:18.320 --> 33:20.580
What reason is there to hesitate?

33:21.960 --> 33:22.960
Father!

33:22.990 --> 33:23.750
Emmanuel!

33:23.860 --> 33:25.880
I leave the rest to you all!

33:26.390 --> 33:28.760
Create the beautiful night!

33:31.770 --> 33:33.560
Father!

33:34.670 --> 33:35.670
No!

33:35.740 --> 33:38.430
The Professor has already made his choice!

33:39.870 --> 33:42.370
But we can't just let
him, it's too horrible!

33:47.850 --> 33:49.680
Father!

33:50.450 --> 33:53.320
That's right, the truth of what
happened at Bashtarle was...

33:53.450 --> 33:57.410
buried along with the melted
down experimental core...

33:59.460 --> 34:00.460
Then...

34:00.830 --> 34:06.890
the hatred that we've all had for
Professor Vogler has been misplaced?

34:07.300 --> 34:08.300
Right.

34:09.370 --> 34:10.930
Then why did you remain silent?

34:12.010 --> 34:18.210
You're his head assistant, you were with his
daughter! You could have cleared his name!

34:20.010 --> 34:25.890
After Professor Shizuma's official
announcement, who would have believed us?

34:28.920 --> 34:30.820
Besides, by remaining silent...

34:30.930 --> 34:33.860
we allowed the research
perfecting the drive to continue...

34:34.100 --> 34:38.660
Isn't that what
Professor Vogler would have wanted?

34:38.800 --> 34:43.400
Even if the truth is lost in a river
of tears that no one will ever see...

34:43.800 --> 34:48.000
"Dead men tell no tales."
It's a fine saying.

34:49.840 --> 34:53.580
Why can't we keep the truth to ourselves?

34:54.220 --> 34:55.880
I cannot do that!

34:56.280 --> 35:01.480
This Still Earth Operation
was planned by our father!

35:01.590 --> 35:03.020
That's impossible!

35:03.220 --> 35:05.850
Father was a kind man, he would never...

35:05.960 --> 35:07.160
It's not a lie!

35:08.100 --> 35:12.290
I also escaped using my
teleport ability... with Father!

35:16.500 --> 35:17.630
It can't be...

35:18.240 --> 35:21.640
The fact that I'm standing
before you now is proof!

35:22.910 --> 35:24.850
T-Then Father is still...

35:25.180 --> 35:27.050
He passed away soon after...

35:27.180 --> 35:29.910
with his name still tarnished
by Professor Shizuma.

35:30.450 --> 35:33.480
And do you know where we hid?

35:34.420 --> 35:36.790
Underground, beneath
the ruins of Bashtarle...

35:37.290 --> 35:40.490
It was a place no one wanted to go near.

35:40.830 --> 35:43.200
It was the perfect place for us to hide.

35:43.860 --> 35:46.100
Father was in such a desolate place...

35:46.370 --> 35:47.960
Can you picture it?

35:48.340 --> 35:52.600
Father was in an almost lifeless
condition, both physically and mentally!

35:52.710 --> 35:57.510
He couldn't even speak in his sadness...

35:57.980 --> 36:02.880
But one day, when he saw the newly
completed Shizuma Drive, Father...

36:12.860 --> 36:16.700
Suddenly, Father locked
himself inside the laboratory.

36:16.860 --> 36:21.000
For days, all I could do
was pound on the door.

36:21.200 --> 36:23.600
And when the doors opened again...

36:28.340 --> 36:31.070
Those samples were there.

36:32.850 --> 36:33.850
Father!

36:33.910 --> 36:34.910
Father!

36:36.020 --> 36:37.810
M-My son...

36:38.120 --> 36:41.820
You cannot! You cannot
leave things as they are!

36:42.190 --> 36:44.020
Listen Emmanuel!

36:44.160 --> 36:47.820
You must stop Shizuma!

36:47.930 --> 36:50.560
Shizuma must be stopped...

36:50.900 --> 36:53.090
It was magnificent!

36:53.530 --> 36:55.300
Unlike the Samples created ten years ago...

36:55.470 --> 36:59.530
these were designed to
only nullify the Shizuma Drive!

36:59.940 --> 37:01.240
He wouldn't!

37:01.880 --> 37:05.510
He did! Father did not
forgive Professor Shizuma!

37:06.480 --> 37:08.310
That's why it's revenge!

37:09.120 --> 37:15.490
And I will make the Earth stand still! I
will recreate the Tragedy of Bashtarle!

37:16.260 --> 37:22.060
All of mankind closed its eyes to
the truth, everyone is equally guilty!

37:22.200 --> 37:28.030
I don't care what happens to the Earth while
it is under the control of such people!

37:28.470 --> 37:29.030
B-But...

37:29.470 --> 37:31.870
Father will never come back!

37:35.780 --> 37:39.680
There is no justice in this world!

37:40.780 --> 37:43.410
In order to see this revenge through...

37:44.120 --> 37:46.450
I'll use anyone I can,
even the BF Group!

37:52.590 --> 37:54.590
Now do you see, my sister?

37:55.060 --> 37:57.090
Give me the Sample.

37:57.830 --> 37:59.100
B-But...

37:59.730 --> 38:02.530
Do you not want to fulfill Father's wishes?

38:03.100 --> 38:04.100
Hmm?

38:04.770 --> 38:06.500
Father...

38:07.980 --> 38:09.200
Don't do it!

38:12.050 --> 38:13.140
Daisaku?

38:13.650 --> 38:14.880
Don't do it!

38:15.150 --> 38:17.210
Don't give him the case!

38:21.120 --> 38:25.020
There's no way your father
would say those things, Ginrei!

38:25.160 --> 38:26.290
Silence!

38:27.700 --> 38:29.720
You're nothing but a foolish child!

38:30.560 --> 38:32.000
Now, Farmelle...

38:33.000 --> 38:34.260
Run, Ginrei!

38:35.270 --> 38:36.140
Farmelle!

38:35.870 --> 38:37.040
<i>Ginrei!</i>

38:38.370 --> 38:39.370
Farmelle!

38:39.940 --> 38:40.940
Farmelle!

38:46.710 --> 38:47.770
Father...

38:48.850 --> 38:49.980
Give me strength!

39:15.540 --> 39:16.540
Gallop!

39:16.840 --> 39:18.750
Good, get her along with the case!

39:32.990 --> 39:34.190
Robo!

39:34.660 --> 39:36.650
Giant Robo!

39:36.760 --> 39:37.760
What?

39:39.370 --> 39:40.700
Come to me, Robo!

39:41.070 --> 39:41.690
Robo!

39:41.940 --> 39:42.940
Robo!

39:55.780 --> 39:56.780
Robo!

40:56.910 --> 41:00.280
To think I'd be the
one to save you again...

41:04.450 --> 41:05.780
Look, Murasame.

41:06.790 --> 41:09.880
I guess we won't be sleeping outside again.

41:22.170 --> 41:22.970
Farmelle...

41:23.100 --> 41:25.200
Quite a farce you put on...

41:26.140 --> 41:28.510
Isn't that right, Emmanuel von Vogler?

41:29.080 --> 41:34.950
Mr. Alberto, you're a member of the
Magnificent Ten, and you did nothing but watch?

41:35.120 --> 41:36.120
Silence!

41:36.250 --> 41:40.210
How dare you use the
BF Group for your personal vendetta!

41:40.420 --> 41:43.860
In the name of Big Fire,
I'm taking over this operation!

41:44.060 --> 41:47.430
You'll face the Magnificent
Ten Tribunal and be executed!

41:48.230 --> 41:49.490
Do you think you can do it?

41:49.600 --> 41:50.600
Why you!

41:54.300 --> 41:55.460
Ko Enshaku?

41:56.670 --> 41:57.670
Why?

41:57.770 --> 42:01.500
This is the gun belonging to a
member of the Experts of Justice, Ginrei.

42:02.040 --> 42:07.910
Mr. Alberto, unfortunately you've
been killed in the line of duty.

42:08.120 --> 42:10.350
Are you saying that
this is the will of Big Fire?

42:10.580 --> 42:13.140
He knows everything you've been doing?

42:13.720 --> 42:20.630
<i>To be continued...</i>

45:28.780 --> 45:29.780
Ginrei?

45:37.690 --> 45:43.650
<i>Next Episode: Crime and
Punishment: Everything For Big Fire!</i>
